  "recordType": "rule-chapter",
  "ruleText": "CHAPTER Env-Hw 1400 REQUIREMENTS FOR MANAGEMENT OF USED OIL BEING RECYCLED\n\nStatutory Authority: RSA 147-A:3; RSA 147-B:7\n\nRevision Note:\n\nDocument #14282, effective 8-1-25, readopted with amendments Part Env-Hw 807 titled “Requirements for Management of Used Oil Being Recycled” and renumbered the rule as a new Chapter Env-Hw 1400 titled “Requirements for Management of Used Oil Being Recycled”, containing Part Env-Hw 1401 through Part Env-Hw 1410. Part Env-Hw 807 was reserved for future rulemaking.\n\nDocument #14282 extensively amended and renumbered the rules in the former Part Env-Hw 807 by amending existing rules, deleting existing rules, and adopting new rules. Document #14282 replaces all prior filings affecting the former Part Env-Hw 807. The filings affecting the former Part Env-Hw 807 included the following documents:\n\n#5053, eff 1-24-91\n\n#5886, eff 8-26-94\n\n#6384-B, eff 11-26-96\n\n#6385-B, eff 11-26-96\n\n#7333, eff 8-1-00\n\n#7578, eff 10-13-01\n\n#9215, INTERIM, eff 8-1-08\n\n(See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Hw 800)\n\n#9367, eff 1-28-09\n\n#10205, eff 10-19-12\n\n#12350, eff 8-14-17\n\n#12922, eff 11-23-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-hw1400.html"
